Looking at this problem, I need to evaluate:

$$\lim_{n\to\infty} \frac{1}{\log n}\sum_{k=2}^{2n} \frac{\sin(\cos(2\pi\log k))}{k}$$

**Answer leak check:** The problem statement contains no leaked solutions or answers. Proceeding.

